                     <div type="translation" resp="part:kuch">
                <p n="1-5">The holy chapels in the north-northwest-south: Kamrateṅ Jagat Śrī Jayamahānātha <supplied reason="subaudible">at</supplied> the city Śrī Jayarājapurī; Kamrateṅ Jagat Śrī Tribhuvanadeva; Kamrateṅ Jagat Śrī Bhaiṣajyaguruvaidūryyaprabharāja <supplied reason="subaudible">at</supplied> that place; Kamrateṅ Jagat Śrī Sūryyagiri; Kamrateṅ Jagat Śrī Sūryyaśakti Dmaḥ; Kamrateṅ Jagat Śrī Bhaiṣajyaguruvaidūryyaprabharājya Dmaḥ; Kamrateṅ</p>
            </div>
